# Subtitle Punctuation Rules

## No Trailing Period in Subtitles

* Subtitles (including those in MD/MDX files and within <Subtitle> components) must not end with a period (.)
* This rule applies to all subtitle text, regardless of length or content.
* Example:
    * Good: <Subtitle>Integrate with Scalekit APIs using our official SDKs</Subtitle>
    * Bad: <Subtitle>Integrate with Scalekit APIs using our official SDKs.</Subtitle>
